,M\\in V\">\\(\\kappa,j,M\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span> (cardinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S\\)</span> (elementary-embedding predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" href=\"?note=a25c0a66cf56c0f4\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md\">../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S\\)</span> (transitive-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"362d2f33099adc89\" href=\"?note=362d2f33099adc89\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md\">../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SuperstrongCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SuperstrongCardinal}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}superstrong\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SuperstrongCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists j,M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land V_{j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}superstrong\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SuperstrongCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists j,M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land V_{j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Each nonlogical predicate now comes from an explicit dependency, and the inclusion <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_{j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\">\\(V_{j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\\)</span> states the superstrong closure requirement.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S$ (cardinal predicate, see [[58-df-cardinal]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md","status":"resolved","id":"a25c0a66cf56c0f4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S$ (elementary-embedding predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-elementary-embedding.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"362d2f33099adc89","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S$ (transitive-class predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-zfc-transitive-class.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa,j,M\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SuperstrongCardinal}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}cardinal8\\text{-}superstrong\\text{-}cardinal} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcCardinal8SuperstrongCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\exists j,M\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{ZfcTransitiveClass}_S(M)\\land\\mathrm{ElementaryEmbedding}_S(j,V,M)\\land\\operatorname{crit}(j)=\\kappa\\land V_{j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"V_{j(\\kappa)}\\subseteq M","display":false}],"bytes":1432,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1541","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-cardinal8-superstrong-cardinal.md|58-df-zfc-cardinal8-superstrong-cardinal]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","5fb1c2241d1943d1","a25c0a66cf56c0f4","362d2f33099adc89"]}